architecture-beta
    group desktop(cloud)[Desktop Admin - WPF (.NET 10.0)]
    group api(cloud)[Ducks.Api (.NET 10.0)]
    group db(database)[Azure SQL Database]

    service wpf(internet)[Ducks.Desktop.UI] in desktop
    service app(server)[Ducks.Desktop.Application & Core] in desktop
    service aspnet(server)[Ducks.Api (Controllers / EF Core)] in api
    service openai(cloud)[OpenAI GPT-4o-mini] in api
    service sql(database)[ducks-db] in db

    wpf:R --> L:app
    app:R --> L:aspnet
    aspnet:R --> L:sql
    aspnet:R --> T:openai

